{"start": 0.0, "end": 21.0, "text": " Who could carry stones like these?"}
{"start": 30.0, "end": 37.0, "text": " They've come back after 60 years."}
{"start": 37.0, "end": 46.0, "text": " Who has grandfather?"}
{"start": 60.0, "end": 67.0, "text": " Who's the one who can't be killed?"}
{"start": 90.0, "end": 97.0, "text": " Where is the rest of the charcoal?"}
{"start": 113.0, "end": 116.0, "text": " The lower woods are gone, Father."}
{"start": 120.0, "end": 127.0, "text": " The fire is burning."}
{"start": 135.0, "end": 138.0, "text": " Then we take the high oaks."}
{"start": 142.0, "end": 145.0, "text": " Those belong to the whole village."}
{"start": 150.0, "end": 155.0, "text": " The fire is burning."}
{"start": 164.0, "end": 166.0, "text": " Silver."}
{"start": 166.0, "end": 169.0, "text": " For every man who cuts for me."}
{"start": 170.0, "end": 176.0, "text": " Those oaks hold up the mountain."}
{"start": 190.0, "end": 193.0, "text": " He wants the high oaks grandfather."}
{"start": 193.0, "end": 198.0, "text": " Without the oaks, the big ones leave."}
{"start": 199.0, "end": 205.0, "text": " The fire is burning."}
{"start": 230.0, "end": 235.0, "text": " The fire is burning."}
{"start": 235.0, "end": 240.0, "text": " The fire is burning."}
{"start": 240.0, "end": 244.0, "text": " The fire is burning."}
{"start": 258.0, "end": 260.0, "text": " Leave bread on the wall."}
{"start": 266.0, "end": 269.0, "text": " You've done this before."}
{"start": 270.0, "end": 275.0, "text": " The fire is burning."}
{"start": 300.0, "end": 305.0, "text": " The fire is burning."}
{"start": 330.0, "end": 335.0, "text": " The fire is burning."}
{"start": 360.0, "end": 365.0, "text": " The fire is burning."}
{"start": 383.0, "end": 388.0, "text": " You built our wall, all by yourself."}
{"start": 390.0, "end": 395.0, "text": " The fire is burning."}
{"start": 421.0, "end": 427.0, "text": " You never told me he was real."}
{"start": 433.0, "end": 436.0, "text": " I told you every winter."}
{"start": 451.0, "end": 456.0, "text": " That old wall is all that stops us."}
{"start": 460.0, "end": 463.0, "text": " It's the village boundary, Father."}
{"start": 480.0, "end": 485.0, "text": " The fire is burning."}
{"start": 510.0, "end": 515.0, "text": " The fire is burning."}
{"start": 529.0, "end": 534.0, "text": " One for every oaks they burn."}
{"start": 540.0, "end": 545.0, "text": " The fire is burning."}
{"start": 552.0, "end": 555.0, "text": " The fire is burning."}
{"start": 571.0, "end": 576.0, "text": " The fire is burning."}
{"start": 576.0, "end": 581.0, "text": " The fire is burning."}
{"start": 598.0, "end": 603.0, "text": " The fire is burning."}
{"start": 607.0, "end": 611.0, "text": " Then we find another forest."}
{"start": 621.0, "end": 624.0, "text": " Tell me a cart road over your pasture."}
{"start": 629.0, "end": 632.0, "text": " The pasture isn't mine to sell."}
{"start": 636.0, "end": 641.0, "text": " The fire is burning."}
{"start": 644.0, "end": 647.0, "text": " I left me this when I was eight."}
{"start": 655.0, "end": 658.0, "text": " Then come and see him again."}
{"start": 666.0, "end": 671.0, "text": " The fire is burning."}
{"start": 696.0, "end": 701.0, "text": " The fire is burning."}
{"start": 714.0, "end": 719.0, "text": " And here you haven't changed old friend."}
{"start": 726.0, "end": 731.0, "text": " The fire is burning."}
{"start": 734.0, "end": 739.0, "text": " Last in the snow, he carried me home."}
{"start": 756.0, "end": 761.0, "text": " The fire is burning."}
{"start": 787.0, "end": 790.0, "text": " Will you tell your father?"}
{"start": 793.0, "end": 796.0, "text": " He would only see a price."}
{"start": 816.0, "end": 821.0, "text": " The fire is burning."}
{"start": 825.0, "end": 829.0, "text": " Tonight, we move every boundary stone uphill."}
{"start": 846.0, "end": 851.0, "text": " The fire is burning."}
{"start": 876.0, "end": 881.0, "text": " The fire is burning."}
{"start": 881.0, "end": 886.0, "text": " The fire is burning."}
{"start": 901.0, "end": 904.0, "text": " That stone stood here since my grandfather's time."}
{"start": 911.0, "end": 916.0, "text": " The fire is burning."}
{"start": 941.0, "end": 946.0, "text": " The fire is burning."}
{"start": 947.0, "end": 951.0, "text": " They moved the boundary into the oaks."}
{"start": 959.0, "end": 962.0, "text": " The stones say these oaks are mine."}
{"start": 971.0, "end": 976.0, "text": " The fire is burning."}
{"start": 980.0, "end": 982.0, "text": " You move them in the night."}
{"start": 987.0, "end": 991.0, "text": " The old shepherd builds walls to steal land."}
{"start": 997.0, "end": 1000.0, "text": " Those walls are older than all of us."}
{"start": 1001.0, "end": 1006.0, "text": " The fire is burning."}
{"start": 1031.0, "end": 1035.0, "text": " The fire is burning."}
{"start": 1036.0, "end": 1040.0, "text": " Watch their fold tonight and tear it down."}
{"start": 1061.0, "end": 1066.0, "text": " The fire is burning."}
{"start": 1091.0, "end": 1096.0, "text": " The fire is burning."}
{"start": 1113.0, "end": 1115.0, "text": " Where are you? Please come back."}
{"start": 1121.0, "end": 1126.0, "text": " The fire is burning."}
{"start": 1140.0, "end": 1143.0, "text": " He's gone because of us."}
{"start": 1151.0, "end": 1156.0, "text": " The fire is burning."}
{"start": 1181.0, "end": 1186.0, "text": " The fire is burning."}
{"start": 1192.0, "end": 1196.0, "text": " I built this ironworks for you."}
{"start": 1200.0, "end": 1205.0, "text": " I know father."}
{"start": 1211.0, "end": 1216.0, "text": " The fire is burning."}
{"start": 1241.0, "end": 1246.0, "text": " The fire is burning."}
{"start": 1263.0, "end": 1265.0, "text": " Please don't go."}
{"start": 1266.0, "end": 1268.0, "text": " Not yet."}
{"start": 1271.0, "end": 1276.0, "text": " The fire is burning."}
{"start": 1293.0, "end": 1295.0, "text": " My father moved the stones."}
{"start": 1295.0, "end": 1297.0, "text": " I have proof."}
{"start": 1301.0, "end": 1306.0, "text": " The fire is burning."}
{"start": 1321.0, "end": 1325.0, "text": " Without roots the whole slope will slide."}
{"start": 1332.0, "end": 1336.0, "text": " I'll warn my father."}
{"start": 1346.0, "end": 1349.0, "text": " The slope is washing away father."}
{"start": 1349.0, "end": 1354.0, "text": " The rain turns my wheel faster."}
{"start": 1380.0, "end": 1383.0, "text": " That oak is a mumps charcoal."}
{"start": 1383.0, "end": 1385.0, "text": " Fill it."}
{"start": 1395.0, "end": 1398.0, "text": " They'll fill the old oak at dawn."}
{"start": 1398.0, "end": 1402.0, "text": " The fire is burning."}
{"start": 1406.0, "end": 1410.0, "text": " It's roots hold the whole slope."}
{"start": 1420.0, "end": 1422.0, "text": " Move aside old man."}
{"start": 1428.0, "end": 1434.0, "text": " Cut this and the mountain comes down."}
{"start": 1458.0, "end": 1463.0, "text": " The fire is burning."}
{"start": 1468.0, "end": 1471.0, "text": " Wake the village. Go now."}
{"start": 1488.0, "end": 1490.0, "text": " The slope is coming down."}
{"start": 1490.0, "end": 1492.0, "text": " Up to the wall."}
{"start": 1509.0, "end": 1512.0, "text": " Father, the hillside is moving."}
{"start": 1518.0, "end": 1523.0, "text": " The fire is burning."}
{"start": 1523.0, "end": 1526.0, "text": " Save the charcoal."}
{"start": 1531.0, "end": 1533.0, "text": " Leave it father."}
{"start": 1548.0, "end": 1553.0, "text": " Go on without me."}
{"start": 1565.0, "end": 1567.0, "text": " Go on without me."}
{"start": 1573.0, "end": 1575.0, "text": " Not without you."}
{"start": 1578.0, "end": 1583.0, "text": " Go on without me."}
{"start": 1608.0, "end": 1613.0, "text": " You carried me once before."}
{"start": 1638.0, "end": 1643.0, "text": " The fire is burning."}
{"start": 1668.0, "end": 1673.0, "text": " The fire is burning."}
{"start": 1691.0, "end": 1694.0, "text": " My father paid men to move the stones."}
{"start": 1698.0, "end": 1701.0, "text": " And to strip the slope above you."}
{"start": 1715.0, "end": 1718.0, "text": " The oak's held the mountain."}
{"start": 1718.0, "end": 1720.0, "text": " He cut them."}
{"start": 1728.0, "end": 1733.0, "text": " The fire is burning."}
{"start": 1758.0, "end": 1763.0, "text": " The fire is burning."}
{"start": 1776.0, "end": 1778.0, "text": " He'll come to say goodbye."}
{"start": 1778.0, "end": 1780.0, "text": " Wait for dawn."}
{"start": 1788.0, "end": 1793.0, "text": " The fire is burning."}
{"start": 1818.0, "end": 1822.0, "text": " Thank you for carrying him home."}
{"start": 1848.0, "end": 1853.0, "text": " The fire is burning."}
{"start": 1878.0, "end": 1883.0, "text": " The fire is burning."}